Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||04-15-2001||10:24 PM||||All right, the time has arrived to bring out the cars.  Just so happens that I have an eye on one that is the 8th or 9th year in a row for New Castle, IN.  Never been before personally, but figured if we could get some people together it would be cool!<P>I have the paper that I have to copy and send out (I guess that will work since I received it in the mail) so if you are interested, drop me a line with your addy and I will copy the sheet and send it out.  I'll be there for sure.||||reg||1
Z||000001||sparks||04-16-2001||01:42 PM||||Great Car show, I went back when I was in high school dating a girl from Kennard.  Her step-dad had a 53(?) Mecury Sun Valley with a Ford 302 in it.  Lowered, flames out the tailpipes etc.  Her mom's car was an '80 or so Porche Raspberry Malibu with a 350 in it and custom interior.  Two real nice cars.  Anyway, as I remember there was a lot of old iron there, good show.  I think you'll enjoy it.<P>------------------<BR><BR>Adam Sparks||||reg||10
